    "body": "Since the last release there have been 2 commit(s). The descriptions for the first (at most) 10 of these are as follows\r\n\r\n\r\n4f3206b - Release Version 2.9 (#532) (Kishor Prins)\r\nf9f703b - Add AMD support (#530) (Visual Ehrmanntraut)\r\n\r\n\r\nExtended List of Changes:\r\n\r\n- [AMD support](https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooI2C/commit/f9f703b760711e25bd094058ecb6f19dea52dc5f) within VoodooI2C (thanks to @ChefKissInc)\r\n-  VoodooGPIO has [AMD support](https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooGPIO/commit/e0ca3d2e08462ff940b97eaef3271c69d8da6db3) (thanks @ChefKissInc and @qhuyduong)\r\n-  [Physical button fixes](https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooI2CHID/commit/9ebbc8f823e54924dc24a43000a61c3e34cb6800) for VoodooI2CHID (thanks @1Revenger1)\r\n- [Improvements to the touchscreen driver](https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooI2CHID/commit/858c6f229e91c4ebca67883575ffb7d005305fe2) for VoodooI2CHID (thanks @lazd)\r\n- [Better for support for Chromebooks](https://github.com/VoodooI2C/VoodooGPIO/pull/15#event-9642129243) (thanks @1Revenger1)\r\n- Palm rejection for VoodooI2C, VoodooI2CHID and VoodooI2CELAN (thanks @1Revenger1 )\r\n\r\nThis PR contains various improvements. Huge shout to @ChefKissInc  for AMD support, @1Revenger1 for continuous improvements, and @lazd for improving touchscreen support for Surface devices. \r\n\r\nThanks @newperson1746  and @1Revenger1  for the improved Github Actions and fixes \r\n\r\nEdit November 6, 2024:\r\n\r\nPlease use the 2.9.1 release as it has the correct version.",
